# promise: #252
# Hovering a dot in a squeezed space dock gives that space the wide cell and its icon, and the open
# space becomes a dot, as in Arc 1.171 (#252, erkage). Twelve made-up solid spaces, the sixth without
# an icon: it gets the 8 pt dot. Light and dark spaces alternate; the first (light) is open. The dock
# logs what each cell draws at what width (pixel-free, so it holds on any display).
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
